# Phase 11 Search, the screen (docs/phase11-brief.md section 3.1, U1;
# owner photos search-empty-b, search-results-b): Music > Search opens
# with the magnifier row "Search" / "No Search Results" and the dark
# letter strip, A boxed; typing "h" then "a" refines; PREV deletes; NEXT
# adds a space; MENU hides the strip (the full result list, the first
# result selected); SELECT on the top row brings the strip back; a second
# MENU (strip hidden) leaves Search.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p11-search-strip.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip
# fulls-extra: 4 each typed letter, delete or space redraws the result list (a body-wide update; the strip types without a SELECT key)
#
# Reaches Search through the Music menu, whose Search row U2a points at
# ui_search_screen (menu.c); the result rows come from L's lib_search().
# With either missing on a branch the script still runs: "Search" stays
# the stub, or the results stay empty ("No Search Results").
# Music order: Playlists, Artists, Albums, Compilations, Songs, Genres,
# Composers, Audiobooks, Search (Playlists + 8).

wait 4000           # boot to the main menu, "Music" selected
wait_db 30000

key SELECT          # Music
wait 800
wheel +8 300        # "Search"
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
shot empty          # Search / No Search Results, strip, A boxed

wheel +7 100        # box on H, the letters still from A
wait 400
shot box_h
type h              # SELECT on H: "h" typed, results
wait 600
shot results_h      # Results for: h, rows with type icons

type a
wait 600
shot results_ha     # refined

key LEFT            # PREV: delete the "a"
wait 600
shot deleted        # back to "h"

key RIGHT           # NEXT: a space
wait 600
shot space          # "h " typed, the cursor after the space

wheel +30 60        # far right: the letters scroll so the box shows
wait 400
shot strip_end      # ... 0-9, box on a digit

key MENU            # the strip hides: the full result list
wait 800
shot full_list      # first result selected (or Search with none)

wheel -1 300        # up to the top row
wait 400
key SELECT          # the strip comes back
wait 800
shot strip_back

key MENU            # hide it again
wait 800
key MENU            # and leave Search
wait 800
shot music          # the Music menu

quit
